---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Ahora mismo" active="ahora">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 w-full space-y-4">
    <header class="glass-panel px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div><h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-shadow-glow"><i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Ahora mismo</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs mt-0.5">Todo lo que está pasando en la comunidad, en una sola pantalla. Se actualiza solo.</p></div>
      <div id="ah-cifras" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs"></div>
    </header>
    <div id="ah-racha" hidden></div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <section class="space-y-2"><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase text-sm tracking-wider"><i class="fa-solid fa-tower-broadcast text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Retos esperando rival</h2>
          <div id="ah-radar" class="grid gap-2"></div><p id="ah-radar-vacio" class="text-xs text-gray-400">Nadie espera rival ahora. <a class="text-galaxy-400 underline" href={`${base}duelos/`}>Lanza un reto</a>.</p></section>
        <section class="space-y-2"><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase text-sm tracking-wider"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Para mirar</h2>
          <div id="ah-vivo" class="grid gap-2"></div><p id="ah-vivo-vacio" class="text-xs text-gray-400">No hay salas abiertas a espectadores ahora.</p>
          <a href={`${base}en-vivo/`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-galaxy-400 hover:underline">Ver todas las salas y tus espectadores <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></a></section>
      </div>
      <aside class="space-y-4"><div id="ah-ranking" hidden></div></aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<script>
  import '../js/pages/ahora.js';
</script>
